  data: {
    LLM: "In MisÃ¨re, lead your lowest cards in suits where you only have one or two cards. Your goal is to exhaust a suit so you can safely discard your high cards later.\n\nThe 'Prop/Mee' partnership: If you see someone 'propose', and you have two Aces or a King-Queen sequence, accept the partnership ('Mee!'). This is the most consistent way to score.\n\nTroel Detection: If the dealer has 3 Aces, they must play a Troel. If you have the 4th Ace, you ARE their partner. Use this knowledge to coordinate from the first trick without needing to bid.",
